0..77 Comment "// A string\'s methods: a module member whose first parameter is its receiver,"
78..153 Comment "// `self`, written with the mode the receiver is lent in, called off a held"
154..232 Comment "// string as `s.len()`. A call is the access its mode names: a shared receiver"
233..308 Comment "// is lent for reading, an exclusive one, written with no mode, is lent and"
309..382 Comment "// written back, and a consumed one is taken, ending its hold (the `let`,"
383..459 Comment "// `inout` and `sink` conventions of Racordon and Abrahams, \"Borrow checking"
460..482 Comment "// Hylo\", IWACO 2023)."
483..485 Comment "//"
486..521 Comment "// - see: #1488 — `takenInOneArm`"
